{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:29 2026-11-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:29 2026-11-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:29 2026-11-20 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0f3887fb1321368b242a241329b59f8/2026-11/001_12.png\"/><p>今日（20日）下午近1時，警方接獲一名工人報案，指深水埗運動場對開地盤有一個200毫米長、60毫米闊的懷疑爆炸品。警方接報趕至，並召爆炸品處理課到場調查，隨即檢走有關物體，現時已安全解封。</p><img alt=\"現場為深水埗運動場外地盤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25e26e3d358ead92edc84a9a328ab4ba/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_15_43_06_1_.jpeg\" title=\"現場為深水埗運動場外地盤。\"/><p>現場為深水埗運動場外地盤。</p><img alt=\"爆炸品處理課到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4750f51d3d66ac8e86183d16f979b624/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_15_43_06.jpeg\" title=\"爆炸品處理課到場調查。\"/><p>爆炸品處理課到場調查。</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.513973+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:29:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:23.689152+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:23.689152+00:00","content_hash":"49723219ab9a37569481e2ac047acba8f5e059ee3c2081c798e11c05364ace27","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}